  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal, by virtue of its failure to provide external amenity space for occupants of the HMO would give rise to substandard and inappropriate accommodation, incapable of meeting the reasonable needs of occupiers. The development is thereby contrary to Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021), CP 4 and CP 30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD 6, DMD 8 and DMD 9 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014), in addition to the high-quality design aspirations set out within the NPPF (2026).",
    "The proposal, by virtue of a loss of Office use (Class E) within Enfield Town Local Centre, and insufficient evidence to justify this loss, is contrary to Policies CP13, CP19 and CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD22 and DMD30 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014), in addition to the NPPF (2026)."
